# inc-h5aql: four sets, all in equipment slots, hands empty. R bow (R. shoulder),
# R is the fixture's own bow default. X longspear (L. shoulder), M orcish dagger (belt u), S orcish knife +1 (belt t).
# The long sword goes to the pack: with a medium character only the two
# shoulders hold a big weapon, so a big M would leave the cycle no place to
# stow it.
@until "SPACE:Swap" i
b s
a M
a SPACE
u SPACE
0 1 SPACE
t SPACE
t S
e X
@dump:setup-done
